    "spawn_area_depth_m": 16.0,
    "spawn_group_side_m": 2.0,
    "spawn_front_m": 2.0,
    "spawn_rear_m": -3.0,
    "spawn_spacing_m": 1.7,
    "spawn_player_clearance_m": 5.0,
    "design_purpose": "Telegraph time preserves a spatial escape; active/tick/damage/radius define the cost of marked ground. Limits remain two major hazards and twenty-four living enemies. INT-05B sends at most six arrivals every six seconds, with a two-second warning even if the preceding group dies early. Encounter arrays author ordered mixed groups and total population (12 Tyrant, 14 Deep, 16 Capstone ordinary rooms; boss rosters unchanged). spawn_area dimensions concentrate arrivals in the central room area with a one-metre inset; front/rear offsets and alternating side offset put groups around existing cover and closer to entry lanes. spawn_spacing prevents stacked capsules, player clearance prevents close surprise arrivals. Unplaceable reserves wait, retaining ownership. Boss vent cadence/recovery create attack windows; guard arc/reduction reward a flank or stagger. Up to three conduits reduce boss damage taken per conduit and return on the rearm clock. Elite multipliers are unchanged."
  },
